L["Built In preferences"] = "Preferencias de las integradas"
-- en: "Edits stay in a draft until Apply. Cancel restores saved settings. Changing tabs or closing asks to apply pending changes; Cancel on the page discards them. Effect previews do not save changes. Action-bar binding operations are explicit and immediate."
L["Edits stay in a draft until Apply. Cancel restores saved settings. Changing tabs or closing asks to apply pending changes; Cancel on the page discards them. Effect previews do not save changes. Action-bar binding operations are explicit and immediate."] = "Las ediciones se quedan en un borrador hasta Aplicar. Cancelar restaura los ajustes guardados. Cambiar de pestaña o cerrar pregunta si aplicar los cambios pendientes; Cancelar en la página los descarta. Las vistas previas de efectos no guardan cambios. Las operaciones de asignación a la barra de acción son explícitas e inmediatas."
-- en: "Expand an announcement to choose its action, event, channel and text. Spell fields search the catalog; exact rank limits matching to that rank. Enabled toggles the announcement. New opens a draft with Apply and Cancel. Audible replaces text with sound selection and Play. Duplicate, Import/Export and Compare are below the list; imports are validated and never execute code. Apply saves changes."
L["Expand an announcement to choose its action, event, channel and text. Spell fields search the catalog; exact rank limits matching to that rank. Enabled toggles the announcement. New opens a draft with Apply and Cancel. Audible replaces text with sound selection and Play. Duplicate, Import/Export and Compare are below the list; imports are validated and never execute code. Apply saves changes."] = "Despliega un anuncio para elegir su acción, evento, canal y texto. Los campos de hechizo buscan en el catálogo; el rango exacto limita las coincidencias a ese rango. Activado activa o desactiva el anuncio. Nuevo abre un borrador con Aplicar y Cancelar. Sonoro sustituye el texto por la selección de sonido y Reproducir. Duplicar, Importar/exportar y Comparar están debajo de la lista; las importaciones se validan y nunca ejecutan código. Aplicar guarda los cambios."
