-- en: "Edit fields opens a graphical schema draft. Add, name, reorder or remove fields, choose primitive or nested types, and edit nested fields. Apply stages the schema and its field order. Advanced exposes the equivalent raw schema, parsed as data without executing Lua."
L["Edit fields opens a graphical schema draft. Add, name, reorder or remove fields, choose primitive or nested types, and edit nested fields. Apply stages the schema and its field order. Advanced exposes the equivalent raw schema, parsed as data without executing Lua."] = "Editar campos abre un borrador gráfico del esquema. Añade, nombra, reordena o quita campos, elige tipos primitivos o anidados y edita los campos anidados. Aplicar prepara el esquema y el orden de sus campos. Avanzado muestra el esquema en bruto equivalente, que se analiza como datos sin ejecutar Lua."
