L["Field names are Lua identifiers. Choose a field type from its dropdown. Records contain named fields; allowed types contain alternatives, including nested records."] = "Los nombres de campo son identificadores de Lua. Elige el tipo de campo en su desplegable. Los registros contienen campos con nombre; los tipos permitidos contienen alternativas, incluidos registros anidados."
-- en: "A container carries its nested fields. Drop into a highlighted gap. Up / Down moves within the current container; Duplicate copies the complete field; the red trash can deletes it."
