-- en: "The chevron hides or shows nested fields. Add field appends to that container. Undo / Redo affect the draft. Apply validates and stages the schema; Cancel leaves the condition unchanged. Red borders mark invalid names or incomplete types."
L["The chevron hides or shows nested fields. Add field appends to that container. Undo / Redo affect the draft. Apply validates and stages the schema; Cancel leaves the condition unchanged. Red borders mark invalid names or incomplete types."] = "El cheurón oculta o muestra los campos anidados. Añadir campo añade al final de ese contenedor. Deshacer / Rehacer afectan al borrador. Aplicar valida y prepara el esquema; Cancelar deja la condición sin cambios. Los bordes rojos marcan nombres no válidos o tipos incompletos."
